cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use KARP in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "KARP: KOSMOS Astronomical Reduction Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A reduction pipeline for long-slit spectra from KOSMOS on the APO 3.5 m telescope:
  from raw frames to wavelength-calibrated, combined spectra with propagated errors,
  with optional flux calibration and continuum normalization.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Alex
    family-names: Gleason
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-14
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/agleason031/ag_KARP"
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - spectroscopy
  - data reduction
  - KOSMOS
  - Apache Point Observatory
